sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor PM as Project Manager
  participant UI as Task UI
  participant API as TaskController
  participant Score as Deterministic Scoring Service
  participant DB as SQL Server
  participant Vector as Qdrant optional
  participant AI as AiGateway
  participant Audit as AuditLog

  PM->>UI: Open recommend assignee for task
  UI->>API: POST /tasks/{id}/recommend-assignees
  API->>DB: Load task, members, skills, workload, history
  API->>Score: Calculate skill/workload/role/deadline score
  opt semantic experience enabled
    API->>Vector: Search similar tasks/meetings with ACL filter
    Vector-->>API: Similar evidence snippets
  end
  API->>AI: Generate explanation for top candidates
  AI-->>API: reasons, risks, confidence
  API-->>UI: Candidate cards + score breakdown
  PM->>UI: Confirm assignee
  UI->>API: PATCH /tasks/{id}/assignee
  API->>DB: Apply assignment transaction
  API->>Audit: TASK_ASSIGNEE_CONFIRMED_FROM_AI_SUGGESTION
  Note over Score,AI: LLM explains; deterministic score drives ranking.
